Data availability

            The non-spatial results underlying this study are provided within the article or its Supplementary Information and Supplementary Data. The spatial results are available via Zenodo at https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.14191750 (ref. 64). The FABIO database is available via Zenodo at https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.2577067 (ref. 65). The CROPGRIDS crop maps are available via figshare at https://doi.org/10.6084/m9.figshare.22491997.v7 (ref. 66) and HILDA+ maps at https://doi.pangaea.de/10.1594/PANGAEA.921846?format=html#download. The vegetation biomass carbon data are available via Zenodo at https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.4161694 (ref. 67), vegetation carbon stock change data at https://boku.ac.at/wiso/isec/data-download and soil organic carbon data via GitHub at https://github.com/whrc/Soil-Carbon-Debt/tree/master. The biodiversity CFs are available via Zenodo at https://zenodo.org/records/20617889 (ref. 68). Source data are provided with this paper.
          Code availability

            All analyses are implemented in R version 4.3.3. The code supporting this study is available via Zenodo at https://zenodo.org/records/14191750 (ref. 64).
